{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "472b46105e113c98009493ceccd2bbabfece2d2d607c64843eb5f47d4de59766", "ja": "エンドレスなサマー", "zh": "无止尽的夏天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9ad00bb76fe82b5686ddeccb49f34cdcd694e8b48e36fe6acc82bae814298ffc", "ja": "劇場のお披露目公演も終わり、激動の日々を\n駆け抜けた5人。海美は美奈子から美味しい\n焼きそばを教わり、みんなに披露する。次に\n控えた海辺のステージでのライブに向け、\nメンバー達は気合いを入れなおすのだった。", "zh": "共度波澜的五人，让剧场首次亮相公演划下句点。\n海美向美奈子学习美味炒面的做法，\n并且露一手让所有人尝尝。\n海边舞台的演唱会举行在即，\n成员们为此再次鼓足干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a348421fcf43b7a6d17454f7aff8de4f484584de424c7e7c9c70204b3900f6ad", "ja": "（閃光☆HANABI団のお披露目公演は無事終了！\n後は、海のステージライブを残すだけだが……）", "zh": "（『闪光☆HANABI团』的首次亮相公演顺利结束了！\n之后就只剩下在海边舞台举行的演唱会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "7bbe6f1c92092fb8e3823d3dbbedbd9f561f3f5574e1a094af287d4b1ca1d6d8", "ja": "{$P$}、\nステージの確認、終わりました！　これで……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n舞台确认完毕了！这样就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cd5a18d7684349b9beacac3fc49e9b35411fbaf6bc6704c5540e3fe3ddb35647", "ja": "ああ。これで設営はすべて完了だ。\nみんな、お疲れさま。よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "嗯，这样舞台就全部布置完了。\n大家辛苦了，你们真的很努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "c637561f1413f43ba092029e108df0cbfc175d7a92f759a2b773210f6f3a67c5", "ja": "やったーーーっ！！\n間に合ってよかったよ～。", "zh": "太好了───！！\n还好有赶上～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "9bcd745063c9b1c23232ca7c627f268c5944500d0cbe6fbeaf6ec2958f237f7f", "ja": "なあなあ、なかなかええ感じやと思わへん？\nこのステージ、めっちゃ派手でオシャレやんな♪", "zh": "欸欸，你们不觉得布置得很不错吗？\n这座舞台，既抢眼又好看吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "b2891fe8bc925f2579ff77d4048ddb7075d9c1b0068773c13d76c0079153e341", "ja": "そうだね。閃光☆HANABI団らしさが、ギューッと\n詰まってるかも！　がんばったかいがあったね♪", "zh": "就是说啊，感觉充满了『闪光☆HANABI团』的特色！\n我们的努力有收获了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "d9d7c941b5bd6fadfec0168a0d7eba5496d49ac8574701e34f9e81b68aa5d484", "ja": "これは、ステージにも気合いが入っちゃうな～。\n楽しみにしててよね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "这样表演时也会更有干劲呢～\n你要好好期待喔，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cbfbcbd55b8030aded8670629cffc5c22817ff0dc16fb6c942a1bd5586cbab02", "ja": "そうさせてもらうよ！\n当日はステージ袖から、しっかり見てるからな。", "zh": "我会期待的！\n当天我会在舞台侧边，仔细看你们的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1883e42a1d5df933c26a2457037658b39ecd9e5b4d41b3ee5e20e1c518e23556", "ja": "それにしても、本当に間に合ってよかったな……。\nこれでもう、キャンプをする必要も……ん？", "zh": "不过话又说回来，真的幸好有赶上呢……\n这样一来，也不需要再露营了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "20e03ad95dc4c213595f5ee9782b8c75af537e9ccb70b2e6bcb80c601d946935", "ja": "あ、いけない、焦げちゃう！\n{$P$}さん、お肉焼けてますよ♪", "zh": "啊，糟糕，要烧焦了！\n{$P$}先生，肉烤好了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "2c2a80d21af9509b9290ae46a785aebafe969db4b221f55ef279b6262ef62c7b", "ja": "ううっ、いいにおい！　美味しそう～！\n美奈子、まだ？　まだ食べちゃダメ！？", "zh": "呜呜，好香喔！感觉好好吃～！\n美奈子，还没好吗？还不能吃吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "c351f6684c9dd717a80fd733b0ca304177d74cd08a6f0813d2fef0a60bdd3352", "ja": "これは鶏肉だからまだダメだよ、のり子ちゃん。\nこっちの牛なら大丈夫かな？　はい、どうぞ！", "zh": "这是鸡肉所以还不能吃喔，小法。\n这块是牛肉应该没关系吧？来，请用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "347ca8dd3df38bb2ba1df6d1af30929b9fc0cee459464a9b05b1c81db541cd7c", "ja": "なんでバーベキューが始まってるんだ？", "zh": "为什么会开始烤肉啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "a718af99a6b159d5b0359b5a11d22c0c69faa8f13a06168282ff43374acd2933", "ja": "お披露目公演も終わったし、お疲れさまってコトで。\nねっ、美奈子！", "zh": "首次亮相公演也结束了，就当作是犒赏吧。\n对吧，美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "47a2789fc7ef50eb23ef3ab242a4ecf61eb53f3f2e896c3b0709f0dc1a379d13", "ja": "食材も、使い切りたかったですしね♪", "zh": "而且我也想把食材用完啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0fb9aabc0300a8621347646dfc1c4e6b210a88cbcc21d53e96353b97199478b5", "ja": "ああ、キャンプ用の食材か……\nそれは確かに、食べきってしまった方がいいな。", "zh": "哦哦，露营用的食材吗……\n那的确全部吃完会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "2a52a03f430f0cfb6a661cd67632474a1cec64a07a8722826d7a378a61c44156", "ja": "それから……みんな、こっちに注目だよっ！\nほら、海美ちゃん！", "zh": "还有……大家看这边！\n来，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "9aa313ff060fba1ee5e8790d1e86281f417d4bf31dd1a3c947661061e8b747a3", "ja": "う、うん……。\nちょっと照れくさいけど、みんなに、これ……！", "zh": "唔，嗯……\n虽然有点难为情，但我想请大家尝尝看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "88fd1c9f0b4cedd32950413fd3be5b66991b8870d0886f9d98a106ea891f829a", "ja": "お？　やきそばか！　今回は……\nフローラルな香りもしないし、色も普通だな。", "zh": "哦？是炒面啊！这次……\n既没有散发花香，颜色也很普通呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "149d6f694c6d0f40d999d52191b2456516566120e051028712f1281788c82cfd", "ja": "えへへ。結局、最後に行き着くのは王道だよね。\n美奈子先生に教わりながら、作ったんだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，最后还是决定走正统路线了。\n这是由美奈子老师从旁指导做出来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac8d4820eb05d44324bcd5849420985ba28f5a0f66e989fe06aa3b38de5daa7a", "ja": "女子力の長い旅路から帰ってきたら、お家には\n普通のやきそばが待っていた！みたいな……。", "zh": "感觉就像是……「从漫长的女子力之旅归来后，\n发现家里有普通的炒面在等我！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "5969d5e41548e062ffb37ecf7c4cbe5161e7ff6470c2c527b3124c402971a9c9", "ja": "いや、まったく意味がわからんわ！", "zh": "吼唷，完全听不懂你在说啥啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "e1b4ead727c9829d564f6bdb2a1cdca91b18633ba768a05bf2fbe4598dd226b5", "ja": "まあまあ、細かいことはいいの！　食べて食べて☆", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，别在意小细节！快吃吧快吃吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "3aa6c0403cb0dd2352f97cd4b5ece79d86e75c515138b42d92f9030d4f504a07", "ja": "ふふ、それもそうだね。いただきまーす！", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。那我就不客气了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "20c65ed93dfa1b976164609a56fd4bc71647693f9e5fd32509640d5b401393be", "ja": "これ……おいしいよ！　ほど良くスパイシーで、\nすっごくいいっ！　これはハマるよー！！", "zh": "这个……好好吃喔！香辛料恰到好处，超赞！\n这吃了会上瘾耶～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "2715a32cc18ed754ede4f7f0271062379b40d487dceab9d33c56439fe38ee8e8", "ja": "うんうん！　これやったら、お客さんも\n絶対に喜んでくれるで！", "zh": "嘿呀嘿呀！\n这样观众们一定也会吃得很开心啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3fc5dff5457d75f4c9d933468cd2bfd6c371ce27f6a2b933476e29d7abb7f72b", "ja": "ああ、本当においしいな……以前のやきそばとは\n比べものにならないぐらい、おいしくなってるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，真的好好吃……\n之前的炒面简直不能比，非常美味喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "ba1e53418e19700c56ecae16889896d6c3b0fda6040ce5b6bc5ddc3bc5a00539", "ja": "やったね、海美ちゃん♪\n練習の成果が出たんだね！", "zh": "太好了，海美♪\n练习有成果了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "e7f2b2ebbbf23cea68b30458d8975ee61b3153f535fd3caf8bd7ce3093115987", "ja": "えへへ……美奈子先生に教えてもらったからだよ☆\n本当にありがとね、美奈子先生！", "zh": "嘿嘿……都要多亏美奈子老师的教导☆\n真的很谢谢你，美奈子老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c94de572bbc08c8f4949558d1d8754d1494f747d1ce05a6e6d6343429bc4d113", "ja": "美奈子「先生」ってことは、\n美奈子が海美の先生になったのか？", "zh": "你叫她美奈子「老师」，\n意思是美奈子变成海美的老师了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "acc4a5c7477d358d6cb7e62ef69df898398fce530ed252589d32a2cd7bcbd182", "ja": "あ、先生なんて大したものじゃないですよ！\nちょっと相談にのっただけで……。", "zh": "啊，我没有像老师那么了不起啦！\n只是给了一些建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "d144ec9bbacd641c207ece993956ea9ab0ec54a4d7e529f907aa02b9a71c467b", "ja": "そんなコトないよ！　美奈子先生に料理教わって、\nおいしい女子力やきそばも作れるようになったし……。", "zh": "没这回事！因为有美奈子老师教我做料理，\n我才能学会做好吃的女子力炒面啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "ba8fa8d2dc34dc508d3235099c09d435bb568ddecc8d4729bc8bb83d1fd7534b", "ja": "海美ちゃんはスジがいいから、すぐ上手になるよ！\n頑張ろうね、海美ちゃん！", "zh": "海美很有天分，很快就会更拿手的！\n一起加油吧，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_07_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "5febe738f85994c9c4d55d579676d0b2f16f69e692c31e08f7bdedb2f6859ccf", "ja": "うん！　がんばるぞーっ！", "zh": "嗯！我要努力练习──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
